	(text "ESC: up to 20 A motor current (THW-1060: 60 A cont.)\nfrom the battery on its own 12 AWG leads, OFF-BOARD.\nOnly its 3-wire receiver lead lands here (J3).\nJ5 to ESP32: 1 U1_PG (GPIO TBD), 2 THROTTLE_PWM\n(GPIO5), 3 STEER_PWM (GPIO4), 4 GND. 3.3 V logic."
